{
  "an4.48:0.1": "Aṅguttara Nikāya 4.48 ",
  "an4.48:0.2": "5. Rohitassavagga ",
  "an4.48:0.3": "Visākhasutta ",
  "an4.48:1.1": "Ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā sāvatthiyaṁ viharati jetavane anāthapiṇḍikassa ārāme. ",
  "an4.48:1.2": "Tena kho pana samayena āyasmā visākho pañcālaputto upaṭṭhānasālāyaṁ bhikkhū dhammiyā kathāya sandasseti samādapeti samuttejeti sampahaṁseti, poriyā vācāya vissaṭṭhāya anelagalāya atthassa viññāpaniyā pariyāpannāya anissitāya. ",
  "an4.48:1.3": "Atha kho bhagavā sāyanhasamayaṁ paṭisallānā vuṭṭhito yena upaṭṭhānasālā tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā paññatte āsane nisīdi. ",
  "an4.48:1.4": "Nisajja kho bhagavā bhikkhū āmantesi: ",
  "an4.48:2.1": "“Ko nu kho, bhikkhave, upaṭṭhānasālāyaṁ bhikkhū dhammiyā kathāya sandasseti samādapeti samuttejeti sampahaṁseti poriyā vācāya vissaṭṭhāya anelagalāya atthassa viññāpaniyā pariyāpannāya anissitāyā”ti? ",
  "an4.48:2.2": "“Āyasmā, bhante, visākho pañcālaputto upaṭṭhānasālāyaṁ bhikkhū dhammiyā kathāya sandasseti samādapeti samuttejeti sampahaṁseti poriyā vācāya vissaṭṭhāya anelagalāya atthassa viññāpaniyā pariyāpannāya anissitāyā”ti. ",
  "an4.48:3.1": "Atha kho bhagavā āyasmantaṁ visākhaṁ pañcālaputtaṁ etadavoca: ",
  "an4.48:3.2": "“sādhu sādhu, visākha. ",
  "an4.48:3.3": "Sādhu kho tvaṁ, visākha, bhikkhū dhammiyā kathāya sandassesi samādapesi samuttejesi sampahaṁ